  "title": "Spicy Sausage Ragu",
  "description": "This spicy sausage ragu recipe features Italian sausage and a simple tomato sauce with white wine, cream, and fresh parsley for a zesty pasta dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
